{
 "id": "create:hose_pulley/intro",
 "schematic": "hose_pulley/intro",
 "schematicNamespace": "create",
 "title": "Source Filling and Draining using Hose Pulleys",
 "texts": {
  "text_1": "Hose Pulleys can be used to fill or drain large bodies of Fluid",
  "text_2": "With the Kinetic Input, the height of the pulleys' hose can be controlled",
  "text_3": "The Pulley retracts while the input rotation is inverted",
  "text_4": "On the opposite side, pipes can be connected",
  "text_5": "Attached pipe networks can either provide fluid to the hose...",
  "text_6": "...or pull from it, draining the pool instead",
  "text_7": "Fill and Drain speed of the pulley depends entirely on the fluid networks' throughput"
 },
 "tags": [
  "create:fluids",
  "create:kinetic_appliances"
 ],
